Keep a shared parent as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared rootanswer as 0.
For every node from 0 to 3.
Place node into parent.

To climb from node (a whole number).
Set rootanswer to node.
The cursor is rootanswer.
Repeat while item cursor of parent is not cursor.
Set rootanswer to item cursor of parent.
Set cursor to rootanswer.

The edges is a list of 1, 2, 1, 3, 2, and 3.
The count is 3.
The found is 0.
The firstanswer is 0.
The secondanswer is 0.
For every edge from 0 to count minus 1.
The start is item (edge times 2) of edges.
The finish is item (edge times 2 plus 1) of edges.
Climb from start.
The firstroot is rootanswer.
Climb from finish.
The secondroot is rootanswer.
If found is 0 and firstroot is secondroot, set found to 1, set firstanswer to start, set secondanswer to finish.
If found is 0 and firstroot is not secondroot, set item firstroot of parent to secondroot.

The line is empty text.
The firstword is format whole number firstanswer as text.
Place firstword into line.
Place "," into line.
The secondword is format whole number secondanswer as text.
Place secondword into line.
Show line.
